\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-53\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(613,-150)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"572\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now, we compute the mean and variance of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.37ex\" height=\"3.134ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.63ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1078.4 1020.4 1349.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\\widehat{\\beta_1}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMATHI-3B2\" d=\"M29 -194Q23 -188 23 -186Q23 -183 102 134T186 465Q208 533 243 584T309 658Q365 705 429 705H431Q493 705 533 667T573 570Q573 465 469 396L482 383Q533 332 533 252Q533 139 448 65T257 -10Q227 -10 203 -2T165 17T143 40T131 59T126 65L62 -188Q60 -194 42 -194H29ZM353 431Q392 431 427 419L432 422Q436 426 439 429T449 439T461 453T472 471T484 495T493 524T501 560Q503 569 503 593Q503 611 502 616Q487 667 426 667Q384 667 347 643T286 582T247 514T224 455Q219 439 186 308T152 168Q151 163 151 147Q151 99 173 68Q204 26 260 26Q302 26 349 51T425 137Q441 171 449 214T457 279Q457 337 422 372Q380 358 347 358H337Q258 358 258 389Q258 396 261 403Q275 431 353 431Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMAIN-5E\" d=\"M112 560L249 694L257 686Q387 562 387 560L361 531Q359 532 303 581L250 627L195 580Q182 569 169 557T148 538L140 532Q138 530 125 546L112 560Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-widt